                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa32afcc-4d12-3bfd-9f4d-4c26d6e15081",
                                        "entry_id": "7ce61d07-2e03-3cd5-a2e1-b8b2a0088b99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To intrude or interrupt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c088814-d42e-4643-8054-04db65f61561",
                                                "sense_id": "fa32afcc-4d12-3bfd-9f4d-4c26d6e15081",
                                                "text": "“If something breaks during the day, work hours up until the evening, we’ll cut in — if we’re in the middle of, let’s say, a magazine program or a podcast on tape or a re-air of the game,” Radovich said."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87e1eb5e-fa6a-495b-a136-9e6a8207656f",
                                                "sense_id": "fa32afcc-4d12-3bfd-9f4d-4c26d6e15081",
                                                "text": "Taxon concepts […] are being produced at a fast rate and, as long as some minimal aspect of the rules of nomenclature laid down in the relevant code is fulfilled, these concepts can become permanent even when they may be deeply flawed scientifically. It is an ideal situation for someone to cut in – inappropriately – and produce large quantities of taxon names."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eba70daa-62ad-3716-a2f5-dca4ac5adab7",
                                        "entry_id": "7ce61d07-2e03-3cd5-a2e1-b8b2a0088b99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To intrude or interrupt.",
                                            "To take up a portion of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "469b1d74-ba05-4880-8955-f673ecca978f",
                                                "sense_id": "eba70daa-62ad-3716-a2f5-dca4ac5adab7",
                                                "text": "This is cutting in on my free time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "665d2ca0-7017-378f-9ddb-ca7993c4dc07",
                                        "entry_id": "7ce61d07-2e03-3cd5-a2e1-b8b2a0088b99",
                                        "glosses": [
